```
# CMake build artifacts
build/
cmake-build-*/

# Qt autogen files
*_autogen/

# Compiled object files
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Executables
*.exe
*.out

# CMake specific
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
Makefile
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json

# Qt MOC files
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h

# Progress and temporary files
*.d
*.dSYM/
*.log
*.tmp

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Python artifacts (if any Python in project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
dist/
bin/
lib/
share/

# Logs
*.log

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```